  "project_description": "Better Taxonomy enhances Drupal core's taxonomy term overview page. It replaces the per-vocabulary overview with an augmented UI that adds a name filter, a bulk \"Add multiple terms\" form (accepting a dash-indented multi-line hierarchy), and a \"Delete all terms\" batch operation reachable from the vocabulary collection, the vocabulary edit page, and the overview page. It ships no new entities, permissions, or configuration; access follows core taxonomy permissions.",
